\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, UnsolvedMath: A Curated Collection of Open Mathematics Problems, record 1200047 (AMR-011-0047). CC BY 4.0. \url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
\item[S2] F. Fournier-Facio and R. D. Wade, \emph{Aut-invariant quasimorphisms on groups}, arXiv:2211.00800v2 (2023), §1, Question A (Abért, 2010, Question 47) and Theorem B. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/2211.00800}.
